[e00211] time=8:56 pm on 20 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
I'll never forget the day my youngest took her first steps. Seeing her wobble as she took those initial steps really put into perspective how fleeting life is and how lucky I am to be able to share these moments.

[e00076] time=10:37 am on 27 June, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Congrats Caroline! Good on you for going after what you really care about. [Public image caption: a photo of a book shelf filled with books in a room]

[e00118] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
