[e00066] time=10:37 am on 27 June, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
It was an awesome time, Caroline! We explored nature, roasted marshmallows around the campfire and even went on a hike. The view from the top was amazing! The 2 younger kids love nature. It was so special having these moments together as a family - I'll never forget it!

[e00374] time=10:31 am on 13 October, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Wow, sounds amazing! What was the event like? Those posters are great!

[e00116] time=4:33 pm on 12 July, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Caroline, so glad you got the support! Your experience really brought you to where you need to be. You're gonna make a huge difference! This book I read last year reminds me to always pursue my dreams, just like you are doing!🌟 [Public image caption: a photography of a book cover with a gold coin on it]

[e00320] time=3:19 pm on 28 August, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Yeah, that pic was from a show I went to. It was so much fun and reminded me of how music brings us together. [Public image caption: a photo of a crowd of people at a concert with their hands in the air]

[e00225] time=2:24 pm on 14 August, 2023 speaker=Caroline type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
My art is about expressing my trans experience. It's my way of showing my story and helping people understand the trans community. [Public image caption: a photo of a painting of a woman with a cow in her lap]

[e00218] time=2:24 pm on 14 August, 2023 speaker=Melanie type=log source={"channel": "hook", "message_role": "user"}
Thanks, Caroline! It was Matt Patterson, he is so talented! His voice and songs were amazing. What's up with you? Anything interesting going on?
